{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664040/extras/86fa2758d5f92f44e08fb044013ffbba.avif?t=1524441105\" width=616 height=174 /></span><br><strong>Staff Wars: Wizard Rumble</strong> is a chaotic, round based party game for 2-4 players. You and your fellow Magi will compete atop a shoddily constructed Wizard Tower, where everything you do threatens to take the floor out from beneath you!<br>A variety of high-powered explosive spells, items, and gadgets will aid in the destruction of the arena, and propel you towards your rightful title as the wielder of the Staff of Cool! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664040/extras/e124a43daa219d5b64eff3f6be8bbc3c.webp?t=1524441105\" width=200 height=38 /></span><br>Rounds are tense, fast-paced, and inevitably end in the demise of all Wizards involved.<br>Anyone who stops in place for too long will find the floor falling out from underneath them - if a rocket doesnt get them first! Dodge, shoot, and <i>maybe</i> even <i>MAGIC</i> your way into being the last Wizard standing at the end of the round!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664040/extras/e634197cad65e9582f96868954bbebc4.webp?t=1524441105\" width=185 height=38 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Local and Online Multiplayer for 2-4 Wizards<br></li><li> Choose your ideal gameplay with customizable game parameters.<br></li><li> Duel atop the Wizard Tower, enjoy a violent picnic in the Magical Forest, or satiate your sweet tooth for violence in the Candyland.<br></li><li> 5 Unique Items, each having a huge impact on gameplay<br></li><li> Costumes! Dress your wizard to look the part with a variety of different outfits.<br></li><li> Experiment with unique item interactions - block Rockets with magical Ice! Pull live Bombs around with a Fishing Hook!<br></li><li> Varying map sizes. Play an intense, fast-paced round on our small maps or a battle of attrition on our large maps.<br></li><li> Over 40 Unique level layouts<br></li><li> Now featuring <strong>Singleplayer</strong>!</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"ab5dd64774bac4e4794021bfbde4d441f58a82c7.jpg","localized_name":"First death","name":"First death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/664040/ab5dd64774bac4e4794021bfbde4d441f58a82c7.jpg"},{"icon":"72e5b15b1dd9c82e193bd8cc1900197240f828ba.jpg","localized_name":"Die 50 times","name":"Die 50 times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/664040/72e5b15b1dd9c82e193bd8cc1900197240f828ba.jpg"},{"icon":"4ac5bfcd862fc64130ea19a2624e8026f734bf48.jpg","localized_name":"Die 500 times","name":"Die 500 times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/664040/4ac5bfcd862fc64130ea19a2624e8026f734bf48.jpg"},{"icon":"a2453609cf1c43467c58516384a415c67acdc402.jpg","localized_name":"First win","name":"First win","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/664040/a2453609cf1c43467c58516384a415c67acdc402.jpg"},{"icon":"b232c6c50d0837c36bfb69d17e7ff21fc5847fcf.jpg","localized_name":"Win 10 games","name":"Win 10 games","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/664040/b232c6c50d0837c36bfb69d17e7ff21fc5847fcf.jpg"},{"icon":"b5bbb38f2c1aae8cd537ccf7edd69ea66c584ce4.jpg","localized_name":"Win 100 games","name":"Win 100 games","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/664040/b5bbb38f2c1aae8cd537ccf7edd69ea66c584ce4.jpg"},{"icon":"8c7cb55d445d544d6b1f3552dacd4c1454907a54.jpg","localized_name":"Party time!","name":"Party time!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/664040/8c7cb55d445d544d6b1f3552dacd4c1454907a5